{"id":"n73265-1-7","stage":4,"title":"폭 · 宽度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73265-1-7-1","ko":"나는 어깨의 폭이 좁아서 아무 옷이나 못 입어.","zh":"我的肩宽比较窄，所以不是什么衣服都能穿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어깨의","meaning":"肩，肩膀","explanation":"어깨：肩，肩膀；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어깨","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29970","senseId":"1","lemma":"어깨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"폭이","meaning":"宽度，幅","explanation":"폭：宽度，幅；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"폭","audio":"/audio/a986625d9a2fb282eb38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73265","senseId":"1","lemma":"폭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좁아서","meaning":"窄，狭窄","explanation":"좁다：窄，狭窄；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"2","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷이나","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","explanation":"못：没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"3","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입어.","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7881b57e7d18b91a","term":"어깨","zh":"肩，肩膀","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3","entryId":"29970","definition":"从脖子下端到胳膊上端的身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["어깨"]},{"id":"a986625d9a2fb282","term":"폭","zh":"宽度，幅","audio":"/audio/a986625d9a2fb282eb38.mp3","entryId":"73265","definition":"平面或宽物体的横向长度。","pronunciation":["폭"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"窄，狭窄","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"路的宽度或物体与物体间的距离较短。","pronunciation":["좁따"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5c8ab7db5f32d7c678a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73265-1-7-2","ko":"그렇구나. 나는 어깨가 너무 넓어서 아무 옷이나 못 입는데.","zh":"原来如此。我的肩太宽了，所以也不是什么衣服都能穿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇구나.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어깨가","meaning":"肩，肩膀","explanation":"어깨：肩，肩膀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어깨","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29970","senseId":"1","lemma":"어깨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넓어서","meaning":"宽","explanation":"넓다：宽；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넓다","audio":"/audio/a1c6fc943afd6c1195c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64511","senseId":"2","lemma":"넓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷이나","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","explanation":"못：没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"3","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입는데.","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7881b57e7d18b91a","term":"어깨","zh":"肩，肩膀","audio":"/audio/7881b57e7d18b91acaf0.mp3","entryId":"29970","definition":"从脖子下端到胳膊上端的身体的一部分。","pronunciation":["어깨"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"a1c6fc943afd6c11","term":"넓다","zh":"宽","audio":"/audio/a1c6fc943afd6c1195c8.mp3","entryId":"64511","definition":"宽度大。","pronunciation":["널따"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]}],"audio":"/audio/95a76f9e07d94a1de4eb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.195,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73265","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["原来如此。我的肩太宽了，所以也不是什么衣服都能穿。","敏俊和你和解了吗？","我的肩宽比较窄，所以不是什么衣服都能穿。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["原来如此。我的肩太宽了，所以也不是什么衣服都能穿。","我的肩宽比较窄，所以不是什么衣服都能穿。","敏俊和你和解了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
